      <p begin="00:02.655" end="00:10.655" ttm:agent="v1">Knew from the start it would end this way</p>
      <p begin="00:15.440" end="00:23.440" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me how it feels to fade away, away from me</p>
      <p begin="00:27.509" end="00:34.099" ttm:agent="v1">Why won't you run away from this world to escape</p>
      <p begin="00:34.099" end="00:40.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run away from this world to escape)</p>
